WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.111
The drone from lecture six

2
00:00:05.196 --> 00:00:07.237
gets a fourth button, s.

3
00:00:07.237 --> 00:00:10.723
It moves one step north and one step up.

4
00:00:10.808 --> 00:00:13.954
The four buttons are the four columns

5
00:00:14.039 --> 00:00:16.420
of a three by four matrix A.

6
00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:20.464
Which presses bring the drone back home?

7
00:00:20.464 --> 00:00:24.342
That is A x equals zero: three equations

8
00:00:24.342 --> 00:00:25.727
four unknowns.

9
00:00:25.727 --> 00:00:29.052
The old recipe two, one, minus one

10
00:00:29.052 --> 00:00:30.714
zero still works.

11
00:00:30.714 --> 00:00:34.408
East: two plus one minus three is zero.

12
00:00:34.408 --> 00:00:37.732
North: four plus three minus seven.

13
00:00:37.732 --> 00:00:40.410
Up: two plus two minus four.

14
00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.636
With a fourth button

15
00:00:42.636 --> 00:00:45.405
is the nullspace still a line

16
00:00:45.405 --> 00:00:47.281
or something bigger?

17
00:00:47.281 --> 00:00:48.800
Pause and guess.

18
00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:54.170
Elimination answers for

19
00:00:54.248 --> 00:00:55.882
every recipe at once.

20
00:00:55.882 --> 00:00:58.372
It never changes the nullspace

21
00:00:58.372 --> 00:01:00.940
because each step can be undone.

22
00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:05.963
Row two minus two times row one is zero

23
00:01:05.963 --> 00:01:07.716
one, one, one.

24
00:01:07.716 --> 00:01:12.506
Row three minus row one is the same row.

25
00:01:12.506 --> 00:01:17.530
Then row three minus row two is all zeros.

26
00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:20.092
The result is U, a staircase.

27
00:01:20.168 --> 00:01:22.914
Each row starts with a pivot further

28
00:01:22.991 --> 00:01:24.898
right than the row above

29
00:01:24.898 --> 00:01:27.720
and the zero row sits at the bottom.

30
00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:31.403
Columns one and two hold the pivots

31
00:01:31.403 --> 00:01:33.816
they are the pivot columns.

32
00:01:33.816 --> 00:01:36.918
The rank r is the number of pivots

33
00:01:36.918 --> 00:01:37.780
here two.

34
00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:41.045
Columns three and four have no pivot.

35
00:01:41.045 --> 00:01:43.172
They are the free columns

36
00:01:43.251 --> 00:01:45.300
and x three and x four are

37
00:01:45.378 --> 00:01:48.530
the free variables: you may choose them.

38
00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.829
U says two things.

39
00:01:50.829 --> 00:01:55.700
x one plus x two plus three x three is zero.

40
00:01:55.700 --> 00:02:00.030
x two plus x three plus x four is zero.

41
00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:04.360
Two equations cannot fix four unknowns.

42
00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:08.245
So picture the free choices as a plane

43
00:02:08.245 --> 00:02:10.533
x three across, x four up.

44
00:02:10.618 --> 00:02:12.906
This arrow is one choice of

45
00:02:12.991 --> 00:02:14.940
the two free variables.

46
00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.700
Once you choose

47
00:02:16.788 --> 00:02:19.343
back substitution has nothing

48
00:02:19.431 --> 00:02:20.753
left to choose.

49
00:02:20.753 --> 00:02:23.837
The second equation decides x two.

50
00:02:23.837 --> 00:02:26.480
Then the first decides x one.

51
00:02:26.568 --> 00:02:29.476
So each point of this plane gives

52
00:02:29.564 --> 00:02:33.000
exactly one solution, and a new choice

53
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.410
a new solution.

54
00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:37.258
The simplest choices are

55
00:02:37.352 --> 00:02:39.242
the two unit points.

56
00:02:39.242 --> 00:02:43.210
First, x three is one and x four is zero.

57
00:02:43.305 --> 00:02:45.856
The second equation gives x

58
00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:48.124
two equal to minus one.

59
00:02:48.218 --> 00:02:50.769
The first gives x one equal

60
00:02:50.864 --> 00:02:53.698
to one minus three, minus two.

61
00:02:53.698 --> 00:02:57.950
So s one is minus two, minus one, one, zero.

62
00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:02.988
Second, x three is zero and x four is one.

63
00:03:02.988 --> 00:03:05.779
Then x two is minus one

64
00:03:05.779 --> 00:03:08.347
and x one is plus one.

65
00:03:08.347 --> 00:03:12.700
So s two is one, minus one, zero, one.

66
00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:16.724
Check s one in the original A.

67
00:03:16.724 --> 00:03:17.413
East

68
00:03:17.413 --> 00:03:22.004
minus two minus one plus three is zero.

69
00:03:22.004 --> 00:03:22.808
North

70
00:03:22.808 --> 00:03:27.744
minus four minus three plus seven is zero.

71
00:03:27.744 --> 00:03:32.680
Up: minus two minus two plus four is zero.

72
00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:34.516
And s two.

73
00:03:34.516 --> 00:03:38.826
East: one minus one is zero.

74
00:03:38.826 --> 00:03:44.920
North: two minus three plus one is zero.

75
00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:50.270
Up: one minus two plus one is zero.

76
00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.287
In drone terms

77
00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:55.842
s one presses w once and undoes

78
00:03:55.953 --> 00:03:58.620
it with two u and one v

79
00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:01.620
because w is two u plus v.

80
00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:04.064
s two presses s once

81
00:04:04.064 --> 00:04:07.953
then u once and v once in reverse

82
00:04:07.953 --> 00:04:10.620
because s is v minus u.

83
00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:15.511
The whole nullspace is every combination

84
00:04:15.511 --> 00:04:19.087
c times s one plus d times s two.

85
00:04:19.087 --> 00:04:23.188
On the free plane that is every point

86
00:04:23.188 --> 00:04:27.920
so N of A is a plane, sitting inside R four.

87
00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:30.734
Take c equal to three and

88
00:04:30.832 --> 00:04:32.902
d equal to minus two.

89
00:04:32.902 --> 00:04:35.365
Three steps along s one

90
00:04:35.365 --> 00:04:38.125
two steps back along s two.

91
00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:42.066
The solution is minus eight, minus one

92
00:04:42.066 --> 00:04:43.840
three, minus two.

93
00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:44.432
East

94
00:04:44.432 --> 00:04:48.472
minus eight minus one plus nine is zero.

95
00:04:48.472 --> 00:04:52.217
North: minus sixteen minus three plus

96
00:04:52.315 --> 00:04:55.173
twenty one minus two is zero.

97
00:04:55.173 --> 00:04:58.228
Up: minus eight minus two plus

98
00:04:58.326 --> 00:05:00.790
twelve minus two is zero.

99
00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:04.463
Why does every solution look like this?

100
00:05:04.463 --> 00:05:08.297
Any solution has some free entries, c and d.

101
00:05:08.382 --> 00:05:11.109
The combination c s one plus d s

102
00:05:11.194 --> 00:05:13.750
two has the same free entries

103
00:05:13.835 --> 00:05:16.221
and back substitution leaves

104
00:05:16.306 --> 00:05:18.266
no choice for the rest.

105
00:05:18.266 --> 00:05:20.140
So the two are equal.

106
00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.315
A common slip: free means zero.

107
00:05:23.315 --> 00:05:26.076
Set every free variable to zero

108
00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:28.420
and back substitution gives

109
00:05:28.503 --> 00:05:31.600
only the zero vector: a single point.

110
00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.030
Free means chosen by you.

111
00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:37.275
The special solutions set them to one

112
00:05:37.275 --> 00:05:38.524
one at a time

113
00:05:38.524 --> 00:05:42.268
and the nullspace is all their combinations

114
00:05:42.268 --> 00:05:45.430
the whole plane, not just two arrows.

115
00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:49.213
So: eliminate down to the staircase U.

116
00:05:49.213 --> 00:05:52.162
The pivots mark the pivot columns

117
00:05:52.162 --> 00:05:54.690
and their number is the rank.

118
00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:57.050
The other columns are free.

119
00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.402
Each free variable gives

120
00:05:59.486 --> 00:06:02.489
one special solution: set it to one

121
00:06:02.489 --> 00:06:04.908
the other free ones to zero

122
00:06:04.908 --> 00:06:06.660
and back substitute.

123
00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:10.080
The nullspace is all their combinations.

124
00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.320
Your turn

125
00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:14.615
a four by six matrix has rank three.

126
00:06:14.615 --> 00:06:18.266
How many special solutions does it have?

127
00:06:18.355 --> 00:06:21.293
In part two we read them straight

128
00:06:21.382 --> 00:06:23.430
off the reduced form R.
